			],
			"Message": "refactor(Mountain): Align ApplicationState import with PascalState DTO naming\n\nUpdate the import statement in `ApplicationState` to use the full type path `TestProviderState::Struct` instead of the raw module reference. This aligns with the project's strict PascalCase naming convention where state data structures are explicitly named `...::Struct` (as defined in recent commits for `TestProviderState`).\n\nEnsures the type signature correctly resolves the aggregated state manager for test execution contexts, maintaining consistency with other DTO definitions and preventing potential compiler ambiguity when `ApplicationState` is cloned or accessed across threads.",
			"SHA": "d61a52c94a249624bbc77eefa14d3a2678ba43ce"
		},
		{
